      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我决定好自己该走的路了。\n富士前辈，都是多亏你，我才得以蜕变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa6121a4edce91d51272038ac1e61d112d536af2f68b675f75356b9bb30862df",
